      "seed": 1888363309,
      "version": 971,
      "versionNonce": 1189434957,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787187715326,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- User uploads/deletes/gets a file (owner access, or shared link access)\n- Automatically sync files across devices (PC, Mobile)\n\nNonfunctional Requirements\n- CAP: Availability > Consistency\n- Scale: 100M DAU\n- Scale: Large Files <= 50 GB\n    upload/download in chunks\n- Lowest Latency as possible for upload/delete/get\n\nEntities\n- Users\n- File (raw bytes)\n- FileMetadata\n\nAPI\n- GET /files/{fileid}\n- GET /changes?since={timestamp} -> fileIds[]\n- POST /files\n    body {file, fileMetadata}\n- POST /files/{fileid}/share\n    body {userId}\n- DELETE /files/{fileid} \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- User uploads/deletes/gets a file (owner access, or shared link access)\n- Automatically sync files across devices (PC, Mobile)\n\nNonfunctional Requirements\n- CAP: Availability > Consistency\n- Scale: 100M DAU\n- Scale: Large Files <= 50 GB\n    upload/download in chunks\n- Lowest Latency as possible for upload/delete/get\n\nEntities\n- Users\n- File (raw bytes)\n- FileMetadata\n\nAPI\n- GET /files/{fileid}\n- GET /changes?since={timestamp} -> fileIds[]\n- POST /files\n    body {file, fileMetadata}\n- POST /files/{fileid}/share\n    body {userId}\n- DELETE /files/{fileid} \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
